100
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:38,040
This is real life.

101
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:39,440
I have a responsibility to record it,

102
00:05:39,440 --> 00:05:40,520
so more people can see it.

103
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:42,960
Grandma, calm down a bit.

104
00:05:42,960 --> 00:05:44,480
He's my Xiwa!

105
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:45,560
He's not! He's not!

106
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:46,240
He's not!

107
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:46,960
Calm down.

108
00:05:46,960 --> 00:05:47,720
Just calm down.

109
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:48,960
He's my Xiwa!

110
