I'm sorry.

111
00:05:49,920 --> 00:05:52,080
Granny Xiufang's grandson went missing 20 years ago.

112
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:54,040
She's a bit senile now.

113
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:56,040
She looks for her grandson here every day.

114
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:57,000
Yes.

115
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:58,960
She's here looking for her grandson every single day.

116
00:05:58,960 --> 00:05:59,680
That's right.

117
00:05:59,960 --> 00:06:01,680
Her grandson being abducted 20 years ago...

118
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:02,880
we all know about it.

119
00:06:03,840 --> 00:06:04,840
Then keep an eye on her.

120
00:06:04,840 --> 00:06:06,800
He's my Xiwa!

121
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:08,280
Don't go!

122
00:06:08,280 --> 00:06:08,800
Grandma!

123
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:09,240
Grandma!

124
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:10,440
My grandson!

125
00:06:10,440 --> 00:06:11,640
My grandson!

126
00:06:11,640 --> 00:06:12,960
Don't stop me!

127
